},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7150201","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7150201,"initDialog":715020101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[30181],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/TheChasmChallenge/Q7150201","priority":15,"questId":71502,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":715020101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":4133105010,"text":"You're here.","nextNodeIds":[715020102]},{"nodeId":715020102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4204784346,"text":"Yup, we're here to help!","nextNodeIds":[715020103]},{"nodeId":715020103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":3078827258,"text":"I was just checking the Pursina's Spike. I must say that Liyue's miners are made of stern stuff. Just two of them were enough to transport the Spike here.","nextNodeIds":[715020104]},{"nodeId":715020104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":727406594,"text":"But since the Spike has some very fine moving parts, I need to check if it has been affected while in transit. In theory, though, everything should be fine.","nextNodeIds":[715020105]},{"nodeId":715020105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3462948994,"text":"#That's what you said the last time, too, and you nearly got Paimon and {NICKNAME} into deep trouble!","nextNodeIds":[715020106]},{"nodeId":715020106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1959152570,"text":"*cough* Well, I did also say that there is a difference between theory and reality. However, I made sure to check everything before you came.","nextNodeIds":[715020107]},{"nodeId":715020107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":487602362,"text":"Everything has been prepared, and once initialized and in operation, the Spike will not need any initial elemental energy input to maintain its charging state.","nextNodeIds":[715020108,715020109]},{"nodeId":715020108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":26889114,"text":"Wait, it doesn't need any initial energy?","nextNodeIds":[715020110]},{"nodeId":715020110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1293265682,"text":"Yes. Before, I had to adapt it to Inazuma's environment, and so I modified it such that it could only charge and operate through the use of Electro.","nextNodeIds":[715020111]},{"nodeId":715020111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1147651362,"text":"However, that is not the original operating mode of the Pursina's Spike.","nextNodeIds":[715020112]},{"nodeId":715020112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":644112026,"text":"Originally, it was intended to function in this sort of environment. In fact, this dark mud is its power source.","nextNodeIds":[715020113]},{"nodeId":715020113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":378000882,"text":"The mud provides power to the Spike?","nextNodeIds":[715020114]},{"nodeId":715020114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1728563626,"text":"That's right, and that's why the Spike is perfectly suited to solving this issue.","nextNodeIds":[715020115]},{"nodeId":715020115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1784474650,"text":"If you consider it, this dark mud issue we're having in The Chasm has both \"symptom\" and \"source,\" both of which must be resolved.","nextNodeIds":[715020116]},{"nodeId":715020116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1219196138,"text":"Of these, the \"source\" is...","nextNodeIds":[715020117,715020119]},{"nodeId":715020117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4192108034,"text":"The Ley Lines?","nextNodeIds":[715020118]},{"nodeId":715020118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":4278744458,"text":"Exactly. As such, we must nip the problem in the bud by sealing the openings in the Ley Lines through which the dark mud is spewing out.","nextNodeIds":[715020122]},{"nodeId":715020122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1560424610,"text":"Of course, the sealing of the Ley Lines will not completely solve the problem of the dark mud that has already come out.","nextNodeIds":[715020123]},{"nodeId":715020123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1878905258,"text":"However, the Pursina's Spike has the ability to absorb the energy within the dark mud and decrease its power as a contaminant. This is what we call \"fixing the symptoms.\"","nextNodeIds":[715020124]},{"nodeId":715020124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":3992756058,"text":"This way, the dark mud that has already reached the surface will serve as a power source of the Pursina's Spike, and as the Spike continues operation, it will close the Ley Lines from which the mud is spewing forth.","nextNodeIds":[715020125]},{"nodeId":715020125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":4028210506,"text":"As for those monsters who have been affected by mud due to long-term exposure, they will lose the enhancements they get from it and be weakened...","nextNodeIds":[715020126]},{"nodeId":715020126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2949131474,"text":"Ooh! That's three birds with one stone!","nextNodeIds":[715020127]},{"nodeId":715020127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":47588210,"text":"You know what? This Pursey Spikesy is better than Paimon thought!","nextNodeIds":[715020128]},{"nodeId":715020128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":655536738,"text":"It's called Pursina's Spike...","nextNodeIds":[715020129]},{"nodeId":715020129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":3756072506,"text":"Pursina's brilliance truly is such that one might almost believe that the Spike was specifically made to solve problems such as these.","nextNodeIds":[715020130]},{"nodeId":715020130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":3753301810,"text":"If that guess of mine is true, then this whole process of solving the dark mud problem could serve as valuable experimental data in the future.","nextNodeIds":[715020131]},{"nodeId":715020131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":2374280762,"text":"Who knows, this research might even allow me to discover some hitherto unknown principles behind how Pursina could affect the Ley Lines using certain devices!","nextNodeIds":[715020132]},{"nodeId":715020132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":532399834,"text":"This subject has great value, honestly... *sigh* If I could win the Akademiya's Pir Kavikavus Prize with this, that would be wonderful.","nextNodeIds":[715020133,715020134]},{"nodeId":715020133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1745979954,"text":"Pir Kavikavus Prize?","nextNodeIds":[715020135]},{"nodeId":715020135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":2410459810,"text":"This is a prize that the Akademiya gives out specially to young researchers.","nextNodeIds":[715020136]},{"nodeId":715020136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":472147698,"text":"Every year, the sages will go over the research reports sent in and cast votes to select the winner.","nextNodeIds":[715020137]},{"nodeId":715020137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1104696026,"text":"The criteria for winning are that the subject must be groundbreaking, creative, and that the person sending the report must have great potential, and be under 40 years of age.","nextNodeIds":[715020138]},{"nodeId":715020138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":2883479842,"text":"All those who have won the Pir Kavikavus Prize while under the age of 40 would go on to win great renown in the Akademiya.","nextNodeIds":[715020139]},{"nodeId":715020139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3029771282,"text":"That sounds awesome!","nextNodeIds":[715020140]},{"nodeId":715020140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":481265754,"text":"Well, let's start the Spike up right now. Let's hope it solves our problem.","nextNodeIds":[715020141]},{"nodeId":715020141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":364334274,"text":"#That said, please take note, {NICKNAME}, that while the Pursina's Spike is a very impressive piece of equipment, it is also quite intricate and fragile.","nextNodeIds":[715020142]},{"nodeId":715020142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":953421266,"text":"If it is hit while operating or if it is submerged by dark mud, which can cause fouling, the Spike will turn off automatically to prevent any further damage.","nextNodeIds":[715020143]},{"nodeId":715020143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":1853385082,"text":"As such, please beware of the mud and of monsters while you operate the device.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":715020134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3082206954,"text":"What's that?","nextNodeIds":[715020135]},{"nodeId":715020119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3120746426,"text":"The spreading mud?","nextNodeIds":[715020120]},{"nodeId":715020120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":361991914,"text":"No, that is just how the problem presents itself. The source is in fact the openings in the Ley Lines through which the mud is spewing out.","nextNodeIds":[715020121]},{"nodeId":715020121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"Hosseini","textMapHash":2239476770,"text":"As such, we must use Pursina's Spike to seal the Ley Lines shut. That will solve our root problem.","nextNodeIds":[715020122]},{"nodeId":715020109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3127707258,"text":"It will just keep charging?","nextNodeIds":[715020110]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7150201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["166001688","0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30181"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":6,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7150202,"order":3,"stepDescription":"Activate the Pursina's Spike","stepDescTextMapHash":1183072948,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q71502"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[6_600100133:1004.282,1015.533,881.803,0.000,284.580,0.000]","30"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":6,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q71502"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QU